# Provider keys for the agent: cp .env.example .env (gitignored), fill in what the model route needs; bench run
# --env-file defaults to .env. Harbor hands the file to the agent process: for Terminus 2 that is the harness on the
# host; for agents installed inside the workstation (Claude Code, Codex: the net variant) it is the container.
# A *_BASE_URL that routes a vendor model through another provider is refused by bench run (an unpinned route is not a
# leaderboard configuration: docs/leaderboard.md).
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
OPENAI_API_KEY=
